From d0f26ca9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: OSSLab <admin@asources.com>
Subject: [PATCH] Port RAM-only prompt progress across piecewise prefill

Port OSSLab 0036 onto Mia recipe 31457d0 / TensorFold fbbc971.
Retain cacheKey, restored fill state, usable/tail checks, and test chunked retries.

